### Description

We will design and operate services in accordance with agreed standards, approved environments, recognised processes and compliance requirements.

### Rationale

Alignment with statutory and industry standards enables greater reuse of commodity services, reduces delivery risk and extends service lifecycles.

### Implications

- Adopt statutory and industry standards where available.
- Prefer external standards to internally developed alternatives.
- Engage stakeholders and suppliers in standards adoption.
- Reference standards explicitly in procurement processes.
- Enforce compliance contractually.
